{"id":"xxgk-c5113a439115","title":"关于2025-2026学年第二学期补考课程确认的通知","date":"2026-07-06","source":"xxgk","source_name":"信息公开","channel":"最新信息公开","url":"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/2026/0706/c5113a439115/page.htm","summary":"各相关同学： 2025-2026 学年第 二 学期必修课程补考确认工作即将开始，为确保大家能够顺利参加考试，现将有关事宜通知如下： 一、补考对象 1. 同时 具备以下条件的学生可以参加补考： （ 1 ）开课学期： 2025-2026 学年第 二 学期 （ 2 ）课程性质：必修课（不含形势与政策、体育课） （ 3 ）考试类型：正常考试（非重修、非考查） （ 4…","content_html":"<div class=\"wp_articlecontent\"><p><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>各相关同学：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2025-2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学年第</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>二</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学期必修课程补考确认工作即将开始，为确保大家能够顺利参加考试，现将有关事宜通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>一、补考对象</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>同时</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>具备以下条件的学生可以参加补考：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）开课学期：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2025-2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学年第</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>二</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>学期</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）课程性质：必修课（不含形势与政策、体育课）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）考试类型：正常考试（非重修、非考查）</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>）成绩性质：不及格或缓考</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>选修课或实践课考核不合格、重修课程考核不合格、被取消课程考核资格、缺考或违反考场纪律者，均不能参加补考，只能申请重修。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>二、确认方式</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>确认时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>27</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>确认路径：登录教务管理系统—【考试管理】—【补考报名】。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>注意事项：补考课程默认为</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><strong>已报名</strong></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>状态，请核实是否参加补考。如因特殊情况不参加补考，请在规定时间内点击【取消报名】，否则将按缺考处理。取消后不能恢复，请务必谨慎选择。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>补考咨询</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>QQ</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>群</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>:1047281382</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>。确认遇到问题的同学可从</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>起申请加群（备注学院年级专业学号姓名，否则不通过），在线填写问题反馈汇总表，本科生院老师每晚集中回复文档中问题，注意查看。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>三、考试安排</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考试查询：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日起可登录教务管理系统查询考试安排。如果考试时间与上课时间冲突，可以向任课教师请假，准时参加补考。《</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>国家安全</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>教育与军事理论》补考安排另行通知。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考试时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>31</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日—</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日，具体以教务管理系统公布为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>考生须严格遵守华南农业大学考试有关规定，凭校园卡、身份证等有效证件进入考场，听从监考老师安排。考试前务必清空抽屉，不可携带规定以外的物品到考座，并将手机、智能手表、电子手环及其他具有通讯或信息存储功能的电子设备关机放包里并存放到指定位置。若考试期间出现任何违纪舞弊行为，将按照《华南农业大学本科学生考试违规处理办法》处理。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>本科生院             </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日        </span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></div>","content_text":"各相关同学：\n2025-2026\n学年第\n二\n学期必修课程补考确认工作即将开始，为确保大家能够顺利参加考试，现将有关事宜通知如下：\n一、补考对象\n1.\n同时\n具备以下条件的学生可以参加补考：\n（\n1\n）开课学期：\n2025-2026\n学年第\n二\n学期\n（\n2\n）课程性质：必修课（不含形势与政策、体育课）\n（\n3\n）考试类型：正常考试（非重修、非考查）\n（\n4\n）成绩性质：不及格或缓考\n2.\n选修课或实践课考核不合格、重修课程考核不合格、被取消课程考核资格、缺考或违反考场纪律者，均不能参加补考，只能申请重修。\n二、确认方式\n1.\n确认时间：\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n2\n5\n日\n-\n27\n日\n2.\n确认路径：登录教务管理系统—【考试管理】—【补考报名】。\n3.\n注意事项：补考课程默认为\n已报名\n状态，请核实是否参加补考。如因特殊情况不参加补考，请在规定时间内点击【取消报名】，否则将按缺考处理。取消后不能恢复，请务必谨慎选择。\n4.\n补考咨询\nQQ\n群\n:1047281382\n。确认遇到问题的同学可从\n7\n月\n2\n5\n日\n起申请加群（备注学院年级专业学号姓名，否则不通过），在线填写问题反馈汇总表，本科生院老师每晚集中回复文档中问题，注意查看。\n三、考试安排\n1.\n考试查询：\n8\n月\n6\n日起可登录教务管理系统查询考试安排。如果考试时间与上课时间冲突，可以向任课教师请假，准时参加补考。《\n国家安全\n教育与军事理论》补考安排另行通知。\n2.\n考试时间：\n2026\n年\n8\n月\n31\n日—\n9\n月\n6\n日，具体以教务管理系统公布为准。\n3.\n考生须严格遵守华南农业大学考试有关规定，凭校园卡、身份证等有效证件进入考场，听从监考老师安排。考试前务必清空抽屉，不可携带规定以外的物品到考座，并将手机、智能手表、电子手环及其他具有通讯或信息存储功能的电子设备关机放包里并存放到指定位置。若考试期间出现任何违纪舞弊行为，将按照《华南农业大学本科学生考试违规处理办法》处理。\n本科生院\n2026\n年\n7\n月\n6\n日","attachments":[],"status":"ok","crawled_at":"2026-11-08T23:12:46+08:00"}